---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Anonymous Text Chat – Chat Without Revealing Your Identity | Airwalk Blog" description="Explore Airwalk's anonymous text chat mode. Type freely, stay private, and connect with strangers through text-only conversations.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Anonymous Text Chat: Connect Through Words Alone</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on June 8, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Sometimes you don't want to talk. You don't want to show your face. You just want to type — freely, anonymously, without judgment. That's exactly what Airwalk's anonymous text chat delivers.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Why Text-Only Chat Still Matters</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">In a world obsessed with video content, text chat remains powerful. It gives you time to think before you respond. You can craft your words carefully or let them flow spontaneously. Anonymous text chat removes the anxiety of real-time reactions and lets you be genuinely yourself.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Complete Anonymity, Real Conversations</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">On Airwalk, text chat is fully anonymous. No profile pictures, no usernames tied to your real identity, no history that follows you between sessions. Each conversation is a fresh start. Share as much or as little as you want — you're always in control of your privacy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">When Text Chat Is the Perfect Choice</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Maybe you're in a quiet office. Maybe it's late at night and your roommate is sleeping. Maybe you simply express yourself better in writing. Text chat mode on Airwalk is designed for all these moments. It's instant messaging with strangers who share your interests, without any of the social media baggage.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Smart Matching, Better Conversations</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Airwalk doesn't just throw you into random text chats. Our matching considers your selected mood and interests so you're paired with someone who actually wants to talk about similar things. The result? Fewer awkward silences, more meaningful exchanges.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Type your way to genuine connections. No voice, no video — just pure conversation.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Want to chat anonymously right now?</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Start Text Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
